{
  "id": "E282",
  "title": "Fishing and Drying the Net",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-12-16",
  "synopsis": "Here’s a perfect saying to describe people who do things sporadically.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/921/038c575a0563269db054a906443db39332a03d7b.mp3?1543807922",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "三天打鱼两天晒网 \n\n小乐：晚上我们继续练习打乒乓球吧？\n安妮：今天我太累了，不想去打乒乓球了。\n小乐：你不是在家休息了一天吗？怎么会累？\n安妮：我不知道，就是觉得很累。\n小乐：你这是三天打鱼两天晒网。\n安妮：什么意思？\n小乐：就是说你做事情经常中断，没有长期坚持。如果你总是这样，很难把事情做好。\n安妮：小乐，我错了。我们晚上继续去练习！",
    "traditional": "三天打魚兩天曬網 \n\n小樂：晚上我們繼續練習打乒乓球吧？\n安妮：今天我太累了，不想去打乒乓球了。\n小樂：你不是在家休息了一天嗎？怎麼會累？\n安妮：我不知道，就是覺得很累。\n小樂：你這是三天打魚兩天曬網。\n安妮：什麼意思？\n小樂：就是說你做事情經常中斷，沒有長期堅持。如果你總是這樣，很難把事情做好。\n安妮：小樂，我錯了。我們晚上繼續去練習！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Go fishing for three days and drying the net for two days"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：晚上我们继续练习打乒乓球吧？",
      "traditional": "小樂：晚上我們繼續練習打乒乓球吧？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǎn shang wǒ men jì xù liàn xí dǎ pīng pāng qiú ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Paul, shall we continue practicing ping-pong tonight?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "安妮：今天我太累了，不想去打乒乓球了。",
      "traditional": "安妮：今天我太累了，不想去打乒乓球了。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī jīn tiān wǒ tài lèi le bù xiǎng qù dǎ pīng pāng qiú le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I'm so tired today. I don’t want to play ping-pong."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：你不是在家休息了一天吗？怎么会累？",
      "traditional": "小樂：你不是在家休息了一天嗎？怎麼會累？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ bú shì zài jiā xiū xi le yì tiān ma zěn me huì lèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Didn’t you rest at home for a whole day? How come you are tired?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "安妮：我不知道，就是觉得很累。",
      "traditional": "安妮：我不知道，就是覺得很累。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ bù zhī dào jiù shì jué de hěn lèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I don’t know. I just feel tired."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：你这是三天打鱼两天晒网。",
      "traditional": "小樂：你這是三天打魚兩天曬網。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ zhè shì sān tiān dǎ yú liǎng tiān shài wǎng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: You are doing it in fits and starts."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "安妮：什么意思？",
      "traditional": "安妮：什麼意思？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī shén me yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: What does that mean?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小乐：就是说你做事情经常中断，没有长期坚持。",
      "traditional": "小樂：就是說你做事情經常中斷，沒有長期堅持。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè jiù shì shuō nǐ zuò shì qing jīng cháng zhōng duàn méi yǒu cháng qī jiān chí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "如果你总是这样，很难把事情做好。",
      "traditional": "如果你總是這樣，很難把事情做好。",
      "pinyin": "rú guǒ nǐ zǒng shì zhè yàng hěn nán bǎ shì qing zuò hǎo",
      "english": "Little Le: It means you often give up when doing things, and do not persevere long term."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If you keep this up, it will be difficult to do things well."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "安妮：小乐，我错了。我们晚上继续去练习！",
      "traditional": "安妮：小樂，我錯了。我們晚上繼續去練習！",
      "pinyin": "ān nī xiǎo lè wǒ cuò le wǒ men wǎn shang jì xù qù liàn xí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Little Le, I was wrong. Let’s continue practicing tonight."
    }
  ],
